---
---

<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="container about__inner">

    <div class="about__visual reveal">
      <div class="about__visual-card">
        <div class="about__stat">
          <span class="about__stat-num">100<span class="about__stat-plus">+</span></span>
          <span class="about__stat-label">Games to Choose From</span>
        </div>
        <div class="about__stat-divider"></div>
        <div class="about__stat">
          <span class="about__stat-num">∞</span>
          <span class="about__stat-label">Memories to Make</span>
        </div>
        <div class="about__stat-divider"></div>
        <div class="about__stat">
          <span class="about__stat-num">1</span>
          <span class="about__stat-label">Perfect Place to Be</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="about__corner about__corner--tl"></div>
      <div class="about__corner about__corner--br"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="about__text">
      <span class="section-label reveal">Our Story</span>
      <h2 class="about__heading reveal">More Than a Café.<br /><em>A Community.</em></h2>
      <div class="divider reveal"></div>
      <p class="reveal">
        The Game House was born out of a simple idea: what if you could enjoy exceptional coffee, warm food, and the thrill of board games all in one cozy corner of North Providence?
      </p>
      <p class="reveal" style="margin-top: 1.25rem;">
        Whether you're a seasoned strategist who lives for Catan and Pandemic, or someone who just discovered the magic of Codenames on a rainy Friday night — this is your place. We welcome everyone from first-timers to die-hard hobbyists.
      </p>
      <p class="reveal" style="margin-top: 1.25rem;">
        Bring your family, your friends, your date, or just yourself. Our knowledgeable staff will help you find the perfect game, and our menu will keep you fueled from the first roll to the last victory lap.
      </p>
      <div class="about__tags reveal">
        <span class="tag">☕ Specialty Coffee</span>
        <span class="tag">🎲 100+ Games</span>
        <span class="tag">🍕 Food & Snacks</span>
        <span class="tag">🤝 All Skill Levels</span>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
.about {
  padding: var(--section-pad); background: var(--black-soft);
  position: relative; overflow: hidden;
}
.about::before {
  content: '"'; position: absolute; top: -2rem; left: -1rem;
  font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
  font-size: 20rem; color: rgba(201,168,76,0.03);
  line-height: 1; pointer-events: none; user-select: none;
}
.about__inner {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.1fr;
  gap: 5rem; align-items: center;
}
.about__visual { position: relative; }
.about__visual-card {
  background: var(--black-card);
  border: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.2);
  padding: 3rem 2.5rem;
  display: flex; flex-direction: column;
}
.about__stat { padding: 2rem 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.4rem; text-align: center; }
.about__stat-num {
  font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
  font-size: 3.5rem; font-weight: 900; color: var(--gold); line-height: 1;
}
.about__stat-plus { font-size: 2rem; vertical-align: super; }
.about__stat-label { font-size: 0.75rem; letter-spacing: 0.15em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--cream-dim); }
.about__stat-divider { height: 1px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(201,168,76,0.3), transparent); }
.about__corner { position: absolute; width: 20px; height: 20px; border-color: var(--gold); border-style: solid; }
.about__corner--tl { top: -8px; left: -8px; border-width: 2px 0 0 2px; }
.about__corner--br { bottom: -8px; right: -8px; border-width: 0 2px 2px 0; }
.about__heading { font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.8rem); color: var(--cream); margin-bottom: 0.25rem; line-height: 1.2; }
.about__heading em { color: var(--gold); font-style: italic; }
.about__text p { color: var(--cream-dim); line-height: 1.8; }
.about__tags { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.6rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
.tag {
  display: inline-block; padding: 0.4rem 1rem;
  background: rgba(201,168,76,0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.2);
  color: var(--cream-dim); font-size: 0.8rem; border-radius: 2px;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em; transition: all 0.25s ease;
}
.tag:hover { background: rgba(201,168,76,0.15); color: var(--gold-light); border-color: var(--gold-dim); }
@media (max-width: 900px) {
  .about__inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 3rem; }
  .about__visual-card { flex-direction: row; padding: 1.5rem; }
  .about__stat { flex: 1; padding: 1rem 0; }
  .about__stat-divider { width: 1px; height: auto; background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, rgba(201,168,76,0.3), transparent); }
}
</style>